@lang en
IMPORT prelude

-- ===========================================================================
-- A figure PUBLISHED BY THE ISRAEL TAX AUTHORITY for s 121B(a). NOT ENCODED LAW.
-- Added in version 0.2.0 (repair 03-721, BACKLOG IL-16, 2026-10-08).
--
-- The amount in s 121B(a) for a tax year is an income ceiling (s 120A, source
-- line 4335) that s 120B adjusts; for 2025-2027 s 120B(e)(1) fixes it at its
-- 1 January 2024 figure after rounding (source line 4344). The text prints only
-- the 2017 base, 640,000 (source line 4456), and the rounding Order made under
-- s 120B(d) is not in this row's sources. So the s 121B rule in
-- ito-121b-additional-tax.l4 takes the figure in force as a required argument,
-- and nothing here changes that. This module records what the Tax Authority
-- published for 2026, so that a caller and the tests can use a sourced figure
-- rather than the consolidation's editorial note. It is the Authority's
-- statement, not the text of the law.
--
-- [booklet-2026] "לוח עזר לחישוב / מס הכנסה ממשכורת / ושכר עבודה" (the cover's three
--   lines) for tax year 2026, the Tax Authority's monthly withholding booklet
--   (36 pp.); the same file rows
--   IL-01 and IL-07 cite. Recorded by pointer and hash, not deposited, in
--   ../../registers/source-bundle/amending-laws/SOURCES.json ("pointers_only").
--   gov.il URL: https://www.gov.il/BlobFolder/generalpage/income-tax-monthly-deductions-booklet/he/generalInformation_income-tax-monthly-deductions-booklet_monthly-deductions-booklet-2026.pdf
--   capture:    https://web.archive.org/web/20260207101513id_/<that URL>, fetched by
--               the capstone's encoder on 2026-10-06T22:02:54Z, 610,829 bytes
--   sha256:     282bb886ccae1cc718840127af378fce88ca37ee3b2b9f00ed2cd44467e86285
--   Re-checked on 2026-10-08 by this repair: the sha256 of a local copy of that
--   capture matches, and PDF p. 8 (printed page 8), headed "מס נוסף על הכנסות
--   גבוהות", reads as below in `pdftotext -layout` with bidi controls removed.
--   The extractor moves punctuation and the currency sign about; the words and
--   figures are the page's ("under section 121B of the Ordinance, an individual
--   whose taxable income in the tax year exceeded NIS 721,560 (NIS 60,130 a
--   month) is liable to additional tax on the part of the taxable income above
--   that amount, at 3%"):
--     על פי סעיף 121ב לפקודה ,יחיד אשר הכנסתו החייבת בשנת המס עלתה על ₪ 721,560
--     ( ₪ 60,130לחודש) ,יהיה חייב במס נוסף על חלק הכנסתו החייבת העולה על הסכום הנ"ל ,בשיעור
--     של .3%
--
-- The figure agrees with the consolidation's editorial note on s 121B(a)
-- (source line 4456: "בשנים 2024–2027, 721,560 ש״ח"), which is an aid, not law.
-- Only 2026 is carried: the booklet is 2026's. That the same figure is in force
-- in 2025 and 2027 would follow from s 120B(e)(1), which is law, not a published
-- figure; a caller who wants it says so by passing this figure as the 1 January
-- 2024 amount after rounding through `s 120B — the amount in force in the tax
-- year`, as ito-il03-tests.l4 does.
--
-- The same page also prints the residential-apartment threshold of s 121B(e) for
-- 2026 as 5,385,285, the figure the text itself prints; it is not carried here,
-- because the rule reads the text's own figure.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `A figure the Israel Tax Authority published for section 121B(a) — not encoded law`

@ref Israel Tax Authority; no s 121B(a) figure for this tax year sourced in row IL-03
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`no s 121B(a) amount published by the Israel Tax Authority for this tax year has been sourced in this encoding` MEANS
    REFUSE "no s 121B(a) amount published by the Israel Tax Authority for this tax year has been sourced in this encoding"

-- NIS a year, as the Authority states it for tax year 2026.
@ref [booklet-2026] PDF p. 8, sha256 282bb886...6e86285; ITO s 121B(a) (source line 4456)
GIVEN `the tax year` IS A NUMBER  @desc the tax year, e.g. 2026
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount in section 121B(a) published by the Israel Tax Authority for tax year` `the tax year` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the tax year` EQUALS 2026 THEN 721_560
           OTHERWISE `no s 121B(a) amount published by the Israel Tax Authority for this tax year has been sourced in this encoding`
